			"interpretation": "This scope maintains nine component-detail demos under componentdetailview, built as two coupled mechanisms. (1) Demo UI layer: exported @Builder factories (PhotoViewPickerBuilder, TextToSpeechBuilder, AICaptionBuilder, PenKitViewBuilder, AIImageBuilder, etc.) each take a DescriptorWrapper {descriptor: CommonDescriptor} and mount a private @Component exercising one platform kit: PhotoViewPicker.select (IMAGE_TYPE, maxSelectNumber 1) updates selected-URI state and blur; CoreSpeechKit createEngine('zh-CN') plus a SpeakListener drives AppStorage IS_PLAYING and stops/shutdowns the engine on stop or aboutToDisappear; AICaption streams a bundled PCM resource into AICaptionController.writeAudio in 640-byte chunks paced by promise sleeps with timeout cleanup; Penkit loads 'savePath' on init and saves it on disappear; ImageKit enableAnalyzer pixelmap is released on disappear with a preference-persisted popup. Lifecycle guards (isComponentAlive, engine shutdown, clearTimeout) and BusinessError Logger paths define teardown behavior. (2) Descriptor pipeline: @Observed Descriptor subclasses override CommonDescriptor.convert to map named OriginAttribute values through per-folder entity maps with DEFAULT_KEY fallback; CommonCodeGenerator.generate returns ArkUI snippet strings; CommonAttributeFilter mutates sibling attribute enable flags; CommonAttributeModifier.applyNormalAttribute copies descriptor fields onto attribute instances. Builders and view models depend on the shared ../viewmodel plane (DescriptorWrapper, CommonDescriptor, ComponentDetailManager) and @ohos/common Logger/StorageKey/GlobalInfoModel, so edits there fan out to all nine examples.",
